    "preamble": "S N Consultant vs Deputy Commissioner Of Customs & Anr on 25 September, 2024 Author: Vibhu Bakhru Bench: Vibhu Bakhru, Swarana Kanta Sharma $~59 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 7728/2024 S N Consultant Through: Mr Aditya Kumar, Mr T Ms Priyanka Chawla an Banubuna, Advocates. ve Deputy Commissioner Of Customs & Anr. Through: Mr Aditya Singla, S Saha, Ms Sakshi Gar Bakshi, Ms Umang Mi for Cbic. Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Vibhu Bakhru Hon'Ble Ms. Justice Swarana Kanta Sharma Order",
    "facts": "1. This application is filed by the petitioner, inter alia, praying that directions be issued for release of the goods (areca nuts) imported by the petitioner. The said goods have been detained by the Commissioner of Customs Preventive, New Delhi on the ground that the same were unfit for human consumption.",
